        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9961)\n- Webhook `POST /generate-trial-email` with **Outreach Webhook Header Auth**.\n- Payload: non-empty string `trialInput`; optional `requestId` (falls back to `$execution.id`) for dedupe.\n- OpenAI returns JSON `{ \"variants\": [{\"subject\",\"body\"}] }`, 1–5 items; each body has a greeting and ends with `Best regards,`.\n- Audit: `trial_email_variant_audits` (request_id, variant_count only). Errors: `workflow_error_logs` + Gmail to `$env.ADMIN_NOTIFY_EMAIL` (no trial text logged).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "9945aa11-bb22-4433-cc44-dd55ee667788",
